        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana Grade 1 Commercial Security Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, the Deltana Lock is a single cylinder function (key outside with thumb turn inside). This maximum security deadbolt is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit door backsets of 2-3/4 inches. It is available in polished brass and brushed chrome finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/grade-2-deadbolt-deltana-cl200la\"><b>Deltana CL200LA Grade 2 Commercial Deadbolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grade 1 Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.2 grade 1 requirements.</li>\r\n<li>Lock cylinder: 6 pin solid brass \"C\" keyway standard.</li>\r\n<li>The housing is made of cold rolled steel and zinc dichromated finish for rust resistance.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</li>\r\n<li><b>5 year limited mechanical warranty with a 1 year limited finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grade 1 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1-1/8\" x 2-1/4\" UL Listed, 1\" throw</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1-1/8\" x 2-3/4\"  no-lip square corner</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DOR-CL200LM-specifications.pdf?v=1704262187\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana CL200LM Grade 1 Commercial Lever Specifications (PDF)</b></a>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- \r\n<p>\r\nDeadbolt is available as:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted by key from the outside and by turn unit on the inside. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Deadbolt:</b> Deadbolt thrown or retracted on both the inside and the outside by a key. Bolt automatically deadlocks when fully thrown.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> -->",
