                "description": "Deltana Grade 1 Commercial Security Deadbolt - An ANSI Grade 1 deadbolt, the DoralLock Lock is a single cylinder function (key outside with thumb turn inside). This maximum security deadbolt is adjustable to fit 1-3/8 inches to 2 inches door thicknesses; and it will fit door backsets of 2-3/4 inches. It is available in polished brass and brushed chrome finishes.",
